      "writtenOn": "2021-01-13T18:25:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you so much for reviewing this!\n\nI\u0027ve updated the documentation to specify each case now. And will rebase on this aosp/1544908 after resolving the conflicts in vts test.\n\n\u003e A related question:  How does the app developer know whether KM cannot enforce this, can enforce count \u003d\u003d 1 or count \u003e 1?\n\nI\u0027m thinking that only when the key is generated/imported, the app developer can know whether this is enforced in software/trusted_environment/strongbox. This probably requires us to expose another API like `getUsageCountLimitSecurityLevel`, does this make sense to you? Thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "eb70f5ba_5fc402d6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 346,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 348,
        "endChar": 96
      },
